	('b0e580e1-6f2f-43f7-82f4-1ccdadb4823d', '499cc8db-9d22-40cb-8b23-728bbd7acbd8', 'Production/Maintenance Technician', 'Together with our global employees, customers, and partners, we’re turning bold sustainability goals into reality and shaping a future we can all be proud of.
Create a new future. Apply Today.
As a Production Technician, you’re a member of a production crew, reporting to a supervisor of an assigned production area. You will contribute to the success of Ball by observing operating principles of all assigned equipment and standard operating procedures (SOPs) for your area of responsibility. The Findlay plant schedule is 12 hour days; 4 days on/4 days off ; 6:30 AM/PM.-6:30PM/AM - rotate days to nights every 4 weeks.
Your Key Responsibilities Include:
Follow all 5S standards and job safety practices and policies including but not limited to food safety; personal protective equipment; emergency procedures, etc.
Operate, adjust, and repair high-speed production equipment to meet plant production goals.
Assist with performing preventative maintenance on assigned equipment.
