	('739a7402-cd63-477b-930e-f995d0117ba6', 'b447c002-7ba2-449b-926b-090b157fcfc6', 'Maintenance Supervisor', 'As part of our Manufacturing team, you’ll help build the world-class, state-of-the-art smart vehicles we''re known for. In our plants around the world, we’re constantly developing new technologies and processes to further increase our efficiency. You''ll get the satisfaction of making great products people use and love.
