	('3589cb9f-8b21-41c1-84c6-7fd02147204b', 'b447c002-7ba2-449b-926b-090b157fcfc6', 'Senior Maintenance Supervisor', 'We’re looking for leaders who will lead transformation on the forefront. This isn''t just a supervisory role; it''s a critical leadership position where you''ll have the power to shape culture, drive performance, and directly impact the quality and efficiency of our operations.
