ed applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or protected veteran status and will not be discriminated against on the basis of disability.', NULL, '9abcbdd3-8991-46e4-9024-97e25045a8f9', 'Fairfield', 'OH', NULL, NULL, 'US', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '$21 an hour', '{}', '{}', NULL, 'Experienced', NULL, false, false, true, '2026-06-05', 'scraper', NULL, '2026-06-30 22:37:57.623142+00', '2026-06-30 22:37:57.623142+00', 'https://careers.se.com/jobs/122213', 'schneider_electric', '2026-06-30 22:37:57.623142+00'),
