	('448902d4-ecd0-407a-9324-0d25a3278e02', '7446fe00-d88f-4264-a00a-7d40ce4f218d', 'Manufacturing Production Worker', 'Join our dynamic manufacturing team and be part of creating quality products that make a difference! We''re looking for enthusiastic Production Workers who are ready to learn and grow in a hands-on manufacturing environment. What will you do: Execute standardized manufacturing and production processes with precision and attention to detail Follow established safety protocols and quality control procedures to ensure product excellence Participate in continuous improvement initiatives to enhance production efficiency Collaborate with team members to maintain smooth production flow and meet quality standards What will make you successful: Dedication to learning and applying manufacturing processes and procedures Strong attention to detail and commitment to quality Ability to follow instructions accurately and work safely in a production environment Excellent teamwork skills and positive attitude High School Diploma or GED required What''s in it for you: Comprehensive training program to build your manufacturing skills Supportive team environment focused on your growth and development Opportunity to contribute to meaningful production improvements Stable work environment with potential for career advancement Let us learn about you! Apply today. For this U.S. based position, the expected compensation range is $24.15-25.74 per hour. In addition, this position is eligible for overtime pay and may also include premium pay or differentials, depending on location. Looking to make an IMPACT with your career? When you are thinking about joining a new team, culture matters. At Schneider Electric, our values and behaviors are the foundation for creating a great culture to support business success. We believe that our IMPACT values – Inclusion, Mastery, Purpose, Action, Curiosity, Teamwork – starts with us. IMPACT is also your invitation to join Schneider Electric 