Must be able to work in hot and cold environments normally found in a prefabricated building without climate-control
The operator is constantly exposed to water, some heat, cold, dust and fumes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9abcbdd3-8991-46e4-9024-97e25045a8f9', 'Carrollton', 'GA', NULL, NULL, 'US', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '$30.79 – $32.75', '{}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, true, '2026-06-23', 'scraper', NULL, '2026-06-30 22:37:20.0636+00', '2026-06-30 22:37:20.0636+00', 'https://careers.southwire.com/job/Carrollton-Operator%2C-Extruder-II-GA-30119/1402364700/', 'southwire', '2026-06-30 22:37:20.0636+00'),
