JOB OVERVIEW:  The Take Up 2 is an entry level role that will set up and operate coiler/spoolers.
For example, some commonly ran machines that would fall under this job title would be: Skaltec Coiler, Windak, and a Skaltec Takeup (BWP), Skaltec and CV Line (North Campus),
GENERAL REQUIREMENTS:
High school diploma or equivalent
Must read, write, and speak English; Bilingual in Spanish is a plus
Must be able to stand and lift heavy loads for long periods of time
Assist with the operation of the machine you are assigned to
Must be able to lift up to 45 lbs.
