	('8be8b55d-7692-4a27-ae40-9f54824b0b05', '22443ea6-1955-4fab-abca-1ff36da9a308', 'Operator, Extruder III', 'The Operator, Extruder 3 is a high skill role that will set up and operate complex extrusion lines (that vary in speeds) and related equipment, including nylon extruders, pay-offs and take-ups. This operator will be responsible for blending different materials within the extrusion lines.
