Responsible to maintain correct wire size, insulation thickness and concentricity.
Responsible for application of correct print of acceptable quality on cable.
Responsible to observe Southwire safety rules, maintain good housekeeping and perform all other duties as assigned.
Responsible for using proper compound and correct amounts of color concentrate.
Responsible to keep wire and compound loss at a minimum during start-up and changeovers.
Responsible for correct inventory of WIP tags daily.
Put scrap into the designated scrap bins.
