PRIMARY JOB TASKS:
Responsible for set-up and operation of multiwire drawing machine
Operator should run correct wire sizes and correct lengths on proper take-up package as specified on production order
Responsible for loading and unloading sets of bobbins/reels whether they are matched lengths or matched sets
Responsible for making all pay-off bobbin/reel changes and take-up reel changes
Operator must make high quality hot-welds and kold-welds in feeder stock in order to operate machine continuously
