Manages staff performance and development, coaching team members to achieve their full potential in contributing to the department''s goals.', NULL, '9abcbdd3-8991-46e4-9024-97e25045a8f9', 'Carrollton', 'GA', NULL, NULL, 'US', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{}', '{}', NULL, 'senior', NULL, false, false, true, '2026-06-08', 'scraper', NULL, '2026-06-30 22:37:20.0636+00', '2026-06-30 22:37:20.0636+00', 'https://careers.southwire.com/job/Carrollton-Maintenance-Supervisor-GA-30117/1397588300/', 'southwire', '2026-06-30 22:37:20.0636+00'),
