	('2da18a59-fb00-4716-ab60-248ee22f1e08', '22443ea6-1955-4fab-abca-1ff36da9a308', 'Operator, Armoring Machine', 'The Operator, Armoring, is a medium skill role will process steel/aluminum MC Cable to achieve safety, quality and efficiency requirements. Initial duties will include but are not limited to loading and unloading raw material and correctly tagging material.
