Embraces diverse people, thinking, and styles.
Possesses a high school diploma, GED, or high school equivalency.
Is at least 18 years of age and has authorization to work in the United States.', NULL, NULL, '9abcbdd3-8991-46e4-9024-97e25045a8f9', 'Minneapolis', 'MN', NULL, NULL, 'US', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, true, NULL, 'scraper', NULL, '2026-06-30 22:46:15.241929+00', '2026-06-30 22:46:15.241929+00', 'https://delta.avature.net/en_US/careers/JobDetail/Aircraft-Maintenance-Technician/32923?jobId=32923', 'delta', '2026-06-30 22:46:15.241929+00'),
