This position will be part of a team of welders, machinists, and AMTs working to repair and or restore airframe and engine parts to their original serviceable condition per Delta, OEM, and FAA specifications. Candidate must be willing to work alternate shifts, off-days, weekends, and holidays as required. Particular functions, tasks, and duties may vary depending upon the area assigned and operational requirements. Must practice safety conscious behaviors in all operational processes and procedures.', NULL, 'What you need to succeed (minimum qualifications)
