	('1c07a094-90b5-4938-a3bc-809a42ae28d4', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'CNC Machinist - VTL Operator', 'GE Vernova (NYSE: GEV) Addressing the climate crisis is an urgent global priority and we take our responsibility seriously. That is our singular mission at GE Vernova: continuing to electrify the world while simultaneously working to help decarbonize it.
