	('db6a4f00-b1e1-470a-a28f-62dc5fe8bb10', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Wind Technician- Horse Creek (Weinert, TX)', 'The Wind Technician position requires local travel within the hub. The Wind Technician is a critical and active role to maintain optimal function and output at the wind site by working daily on turbine operations, safety, quality control and warranty repair(s). The Wind Technician partners and communicates with the Site Lead and Manager to execute on contract requirements and timelines and ensures alignment with GE excellence!
