	('00b33858-0b92-4260-a9df-6e40a21b95f2', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Wind Hub Technician - Sweetwater 1, 2, & 3 (Leeward, TX Area)', 'The Wind Technician position requires local travel within the hub. The Wind Technician is a critical and active role to maintain optimal function and output at the wind site by working daily on turbine operations, safety, quality control and warranty repair(s). The Wind Technician partners and communicates with the Site Lead and Manager to execute on contract requirements and timelines and ensures alignment with GE excellence!
Essential Responsibilities
As the Wind Technician you will:
Work with site & hub leadership to execute contractual obligations per customer requirements and activities set forth with on a daily basis, which include any portion of the electrical and mechanical equipment used in the GE wind turbine generator;
