A background in machine operation, assembly, or equipment maintenance.
CNC/EDM operator
Must be comfortable working with tools and following manufacturing work instructions
Ability to lift/push/pull at least 50 pounds, with or without reasonable accommodation.
Ability to work overtime as required including occasional weekend shift.
Willingness to wear all required personal protective equipment, for example: safety glasses, gloves, ear plugs, and safety shoes
