Ability and willingness to take initiative, and work without direct supervision.
Experience using electrical PPE and safety equipment for working at heights.
GE wind turbine
electrical/troubleshooting
experience across multiple platforms
Strong wind turbine mechanical work experience
Experience using common wind industry tooling and a working knowledge of rigging practices and associated hoisting equipment.
