	('4afe4760-e67b-432d-a768-f4e87b939d3f', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'HVAC Technician', 'The Industrial HVAC Technician will ensure the safe and efficient operation of site chillers, cooling towers, and HVAC systems chiller systems.
