	('c35d36d0-f44f-4880-b7eb-38c0ac21dee4', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Electro- Mechanical Maintenance Technician 3rd Shift', 'The Maintenance Technician safely and independently performs preventive, routine and reactive maintenance tasks. This role is at Metem, a GE Power business. Metem offers cooling hole technologies in the power generation and aerospace industries to increase engine efficiency. We offer one of the most comprehensive suites of non-conventional and conventional machining services in a sophisticated, knowledgeable, experienced, flexible, environmentally conscious way.
