	('c690c192-663b-4706-b374-56c593789153', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Machinist', 'GE Vernova (NYSE: GEV) Addressing the climate crisis is an urgent global priority and we take our responsibility seriously. That is our singular mission at GE Vernova: continuing to electrify the world while simultaneously working to help decarbonize it.
