	('3a56d933-b705-4d64-af12-3b0eccf4eee4', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Entry Level - Industrial Plumber/Steamfitter', 'Under general supervision Layout, design, install, assemble, fabricate, maintain, test and repair pipes and fittings of mechanical utility piping systems, chillers that include hot water, chilled water, steam, compressed air, sewer, chemicals, fuel oil, gasses and other related systems following local and state codes. Read and understand system prints and schematics. In this role, you will be required to move and work in confined spaces, up and down ladders and to work from ladders, scaffolding and aerial lift platforms.
