	('70b54c60-5240-4fef-b307-c5057b4a8a81', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Welder', 'GE Vernova (NYSE: GEV) Addressing the climate crisis is an urgent global priority and we take our responsibility seriously. That is our singular mission at GE Vernova: continuing to electrify the world while simultaneously working to help decarbonize it.
