	('9c54468e-25fc-4471-99a8-d3818acb8bbb', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Assembler A 2nd shift', 'What impact you’ll make:
​The Assembler A will align, erect, assemble, fit components of unit, compressor, turbine rotors, stators, bearings and main gas turbine unit (New Make and Repair – Disassemble and Assemble).
What you’ll do
Align, erect, assemble, fit components of unit, compressor, turbine rotors, stators, bearings and main gas turbine unit (New Make and Repair– Disassemble and Assemble)
