	('100916cc-9f7d-4ac2-9bd5-57cfd389107e', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'CNC Programmer', 'Are you passionate about innovation? Are you excited at the opportunity to electrify and decarbonize the world?
