	('7ed16019-8087-4724-857f-159443e8a786', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Mechanical Assembler', 'GE Vernova (NYSE: GEV) Addressing the climate crisis is an urgent global priority and we take our responsibility seriously. That is our singular mission at GE Vernova: continuing to electrify the world while simultaneously working to help decarbonize it.
If we want our energy future to be different…we must be different.
