Break down and perform visual inspection of internal working parts for structures or sub-assemblies
Shot blast off paint /rust / etc. using sanding procedure
Set up and operate grinders / sanders, jackhammers, oven, pneumatic tools, saws, cranes, blast booth, and fork lifts
Operate scissor lift as needed
Use various electric / air tools
Record measurements on various documents
Trouble shoot problems or issues that arise (according to specification)
Assist more experienced Assemblers with assembly
Qualifications/Requirements
