	('2ba0a1f5-3bf5-41c7-8c62-0a6f5a2c339e', '89f29d7c-723f-4203-9349-d81228744f3d', 'Electronics Assembler', 'GE Vernova  is looking for electronics assembly technicians who have the ability to apply knowledge of electricity by reading and interpreting blueprints, electrical drawings, and machine prints to assemble cabinets.
