* Quality and neatness of work are essential
* Flexibility to learn and work within several different wiring functions/stations
QAULIFICATIONS / REQUIREMENTS
* High reliability
* Flexible and able to work weekends when business need dictates
* Some experience in wiring/electrical or motor control wiring
EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS
* HS Diploma or GED
